    {
      "block_id": "2605.24807_p6_b1",
      "text": "Fig. 2: Semantic Prompt Generation with CLIP. Shows the process of how we\nuse CLIP to generate our semantic prompts, which include similarity maps (dense mask\nprompt), vision+similarity features, text features, and point prompts. Point prompts\nare sampled either from similarity maps or GT labels, depending on the design mode\n(manual vs semi-automatic)\n",
      "bbox": [
        134.76,
        235.13,
